# The live schema store and the per-dataset secret/variable value store.
# Committed projects are seeded into instances from schemas/seed/ at boot.
# Values are not schema instances: SchemaStore::load does not walk them.
# Test suites have their own fixtures under tests/suites/.
/loco-apps/schemas/instances/
/loco-apps/schemas/values/
